  pub_paths_eyebrow: 'Start here',
  pub_paths_title: 'Two sides of every match',
  pub_paths_body: 'Whether you have a property or are looking for one, Homatch starts from what you tell it and shows its reasoning at every step.',
  pub_paths_owner_cta: 'List a property',
  pub_paths_buyer_cta: 'Describe what you want',
  pub_index_title: 'Also on Homatch — no account needed',
  pub_owner_eyebrow: 'For owners and landlords',
  pub_owner_title: 'My property: find a buyer or tenant',
  pub_owner_lead: 'Add your property once. Homatch looks for people whose budget, district and requirements fit it — in the Homatch network and in external sources — and shows each match with the reasons behind it.',
  pub_owner_step1_t: 'Add your property',
  pub_owner_step1_d: 'Enter the details yourself, or import them from a link to an existing listing.',
  pub_owner_step2_t: 'Homatch looks for interest',
  pub_owner_step2_d: 'In its own network — people who described what they want on Homatch — and in external sources, where every signal keeps its origin.',
  pub_owner_step3_t: 'Review each match',
  pub_owner_step3_d: 'Every match says why it connected and where it came from. It signals potential interest — it is not a confirmed buyer or tenant.',
  pub_owner_needs: 'You need a Homatch account. Homatch works on pay-as-you-go credits with no subscription; Pricing shows what each action costs.',
  pub_owner_open: 'Add a property',
  pub_buyer_eyebrow: 'For buyers and tenants',
  pub_buyer_title: 'Describe what you want. Homatch builds the search.',
  pub_buyer_lead: 'Write what you are looking for in your own words, in any language. Homatch turns it into a structured search plan — purpose, city, districts, budget, rooms, what is essential and what is flexible — and shows it to you before anything runs.',
  pub_buyer_step1_t: 'Describe it',
  pub_buyer_step1_d: 'Budget, districts, size, buying or renting. Say what matters and where you can be flexible.',
  pub_buyer_step2_t: 'Check the plan',
  pub_buyer_step2_d: 'You see exactly what Homatch understood, and can correct any field before the search starts.',
  pub_buyer_step3_t: 'Get matches',
  pub_buyer_step3_d: 'Properties that fit the plan come back with the reasons they fit. The search stays active, so new ones can reach you later.',
  pub_buyer_needs: 'You need a Homatch account, because a search plan belongs to you. Searching what Homatch already holds is free.',
  pub_buyer_open: 'Open Find Property',
