  mp_fp_eyebrow: 'Find Property',
  mp_fp_desc: 'Describe what you are looking for in your own words. HOMATCH turns it into a search plan, you confirm it, and the matching begins.',
  mp_fp_cta: 'Describe your property',
  mp_fp_point_1: 'You write, HOMATCH reads',
  mp_fp_point_1_d: 'One sentence in any of six languages becomes structured requirements: city, budget, rooms, and how firm each one is.',
  mp_fp_point_2: 'You confirm the plan',
  mp_fp_point_2_d: 'Nothing runs until you have read what HOMATCH understood and corrected anything it got wrong. The plan is yours, not the model’s.',
  mp_fp_point_3: 'Matching, with reasons',
  mp_fp_point_3_d: 'Every result says why it fits and which of your preferences it misses. A score without reasons is just another feed.',
  mp_fp_panel: 'Your search plan',
