  mp_inv_note: 'The bars are placeholders on purpose: a yield printed on a marketing page would be a forecast nobody made. Your numbers produce your result.',
  mp_ex_eyebrow: 'For Expats',
  mp_ex_desc: 'A structured path for a foreigner navigating property in Georgia: what happens in what order, which documents matter, and which HOMATCH tool does each step — in your language.',
